abstract: >-
  Evaluation methodology, scoring code, configurations and aggregated results behind the
  DocAI engineering write-ups: Hungarian invoice key information extraction, business-critical
  counterparty-role detection, model and quantisation comparisons, and vLLM inference
  performance on NVIDIA DGX Spark (GB10, sm_121a).
